{%- comment -%}
  Resolves a nav destination key to a real URL.

  Destinations are a closed set (Decision #9 / Editability policy): the owner
  picks from this list in the customizer and cannot type a URL, so a broken
  link cannot be authored. Collection and page handles here must match the
  live store exactly — they carry existing SEO and are never to be recreated.

  Usage:
    {%- capture url -%}{%- render 'ness-nav-url', destination: block.settings.destination -%}{%- endcapture -%}

  Accepts: destination (string)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- case destination -%}
  {%- when 'home' -%}{{ routes.root_url }}
  {%- when 'ready_to_ship' -%}{{ routes.collections_url }}/ready-to-ship
  {%- when 'pre_order' -%}{{ routes.collections_url }}/pre-order
  {%- when 'accessories' -%}{{ routes.collections_url }}/accessories
  {%- when 'all_products' -%}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}
  {%- when 'collections' -%}{{ routes.collections_url }}
  {%- when 'booking' -%}/pages/booking
  {%- when 'faqs' -%}/pages/faqs
  {%- when 'contact' -%}/pages/contact-us
  {%- when 'search' -%}{{ routes.search_url }}
  {%- comment -%}
    In-page anchors. The FAQ section's "Contact Us" button jumps to the contact
    panel on the same page rather than navigating away — that is what the
    prototype does (design line 239), and the contact section already carries
    the matching id and scroll-margin-top. From anywhere other than the
    homepage the anchor still resolves, because it is prefixed with the root
    URL rather than left bare.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'contact_anchor' -%}{{ routes.root_url }}#contact
  {%- comment -%}
    Policy URLs come from the shop object rather than being hardcoded, so they
    stay correct if a policy is renamed in admin.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- when 'terms' -%}{{ shop.terms_of_service.url | default: '/policies/terms-of-service' }}
  {%- when 'privacy' -%}{{ shop.privacy_policy.url | default: '/policies/privacy-policy' }}
  {%- when 'refund' -%}{{ shop.refund_policy.url | default: '/policies/refund-policy' }}
  {%- when 'shipping' -%}{{ shop.shipping_policy.url | default: '/policies/shipping-policy' }}
  {%- else -%}{{ routes.root_url }}
{%- endcase -%}
